		<title>Microsoft’s commitment for AI in education: Protecting students, strengthening learning</title>
		<link>https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/09/16/microsofts-commitment-for-ai-in-education/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Justin Spelhaug]]></dc:creator>
