		<title>Inside Microsoft’s two-decade push to cut water intensity while scaling for growth</title>
		<link>https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/06/24/inside-microsofts-two-decade-push-to-cut-water-intensity-while-scaling-for-growth/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Judy Priest, CVP and CTO of Cloud Operations & Innovation and Steve Solomon, VP Datacenter Engineering]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:01:13 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured]]></category>
